text TwoIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HaveYouVisitedGameCorner {
    "Have you visited the Game Corner\n"
    "already?\p"
    "It's no good to go alone.\n"
    "You have to take a friend along.$"
}

text TwoIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_OldLadyLivesOutOnCape {
    "Not many people live on\n"
    "Two Island.\p"
    "There is this old lady who lives\n"
    "out on the cape.\p"
    "She's been there since I don't know\n"
    "when.$"
}
